    <string name="settings_car_hotspot_control">Car hotspot</string>
    <string name="settings_auto_car_hotspot_system_description">Turns on the saved car hotspot when DiPlay opens and before a wireless connection. DiPlay needs Android\'s “Modify system settings” access; ADB is not required. To have the hotspot after a full restart, also turn on opening DiPlay after the car starts. The hotspot is not turned off automatically.</string>
